MAVEN build life cycle
project generation -- dev write code pom.xml files
complie -- comple the code 
unit test -- run the unit test to check the errors
package -- genetere the files war or jar based on code
install -- pom.xml lo dependency pedatam jar or war files lo
deploy -- app deploy
clean -- clean

java file build in "maven"
jar-- java archive file  --- only java file 
war-- web archive file --- java+springboot
ear-- enterprice archive file --- j2ee 

mvn commands for mannual:
project generation -- mvn archetype:generate
complie -- mvn compile
unit test -- mvn test
package -- mvn package
install -- mvn install
deploy -- -------------
clean -- mvn clean
